# Claude Code account-synced skills (anthropic-skills: docs, pdf, xlsx, ...).
# Downloaded by the CLI into ~/.claude/skills/synced, which is a link into this repo.
skills/synced/

# claude-hud's config is machine-tuned (lineLayout, language, maxWidth) and is hard-linked
# into ~/.claude. Tracking it made `git checkout`/`pull` the writer that replaces the inode
# and breaks that link. The tracked template is config.template.json; setup copies it here
# when absent.
claude_plugins/claude-hud/config.json
